flowchart TD
  %% Implemented build-live path; guarded_actions is not automatically wired.
  Inputs["Briefs + supplied OpenAPI"] --> Inventory["Inventory + source provenance"]
  Inventory --> Policy["Policy IR + source gap review"]
  Policy --> Compact["Compact workflow IR / bounded JSON repair"]
  Compact --> Expand["Expand tool/code references from supplied API"]
  Expand --> Lint["Workflow lint + source coverage"]
  Lint --> Critic["Independent source critic"]
  Critic --> DryRun["Remote schema dry-run"]
  DryRun --> Publish["Save + publish workflow"]
  Publish --> Readback["Fixed phone model + authored-field readback"]
  Readback --> Practice["Optional serial registered practice<br/>Ledger + conversation verdicts"]
  Practice --> Evidence["Platform export + artifacts / traces<br/>Live final_ready=false"]
  Lint -->|rejected: bounded repair| Compact
  Critic -->|rejected: bounded repair| Compact
  DryRun -->|schema rejection: bounded repair| Compact
  Practice -->|failed: repair if budget permits| Compact
